# Chamfer of an edge of the solid that no entity draws (an extension):
# where the notch of testdata/topo/slot.tlspr (slot.go) meets the front,
# an upright edge is hovered and selected on the model, its name and
# length shown, and chamfered; the chamfer's screen names the edge by
# the faces it lies between. A face picked with it is no edge.
file $testdata/topo/slot.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 378.3 404.6
dump
click-edge the edge between side face of g003-block from r005-line-segment and side face of g005-slot from r00a-line-segment
dump
tw
menu Features|Chamfer Edges
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
